  "conclusion": "Wenzl 1988 Hecke branching verified numerically: the (\u03bc,\u03bd)-block-diagonal action of \u03b2_1, \u03b2_2 in the LR decomposition V_\u03bb = \u2295 c^\u03bb_{\u03bc\u03bd} V_\u03bc \u2297 V_\u03bd holds exactly for the disjoint-strand action. The deuteron-vs-disjoint ratios isolate the \u03b1_shift(I; \u03bb, \u03bc, \u03bd) contributions of the inter-nucleon interface I \u2014 explicit values per \u03bb \u22a2 6 in `deuteron_interface_ratios` provide benchmarks for the open Hoefsmit-pole-order computation.",
